          desc: '''After reset, each pad's attribute output shall be the reset value of the pad's entry in the top's configuration, and all 0 for a pad whose entry sets no attribute. Fields that the pad's type does not keep shall be 0.'''
          source: [
            '''!!MIO_PAD_ATTR'''
